Z||000000||Jaei Sun||01-12-2001||12:17 AM||||I was browsing a fiero album on photopoint and came across this:<P> <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/mst3o0o/89_GTP_Exists.jpg"> <P>Looks to me like the 89 GTP prototype with a little weather damage.  According to the album notes this photo was taken in 96 at a Michigan plant.  The album can be found here:<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=29019&a=173052" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=29019&a=173052</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||01-12-2001||01:01 AM||||Interesting picture......I don't think that the Fiero pictured is the same as the one you have outlined.  It sort of looks like one of the turbo prototypes, but it's hard to say.<P>The silver GT next to it is the 4 seat concept.  It was used to test the feasibility of the space frame design (can you say Saturn?).||||reg||1
